IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STRINGS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FIRST  PIC X(10) VALUE "Ada".
01 WS-LAST   PIC X(10) VALUE "Lovelace".
01 WS-FULL   PIC X(30) VALUE "".
01 WS-CSV    PIC X(20) VALUE "red,green,blue".
01 WS-A      PIC X(10) VALUE "".
01 WS-B      PIC X(10) VALUE "".
01 WS-C      PIC X(10) VALUE "".
01 WS-TEXT   PIC X(20) VALUE "banana".
01 WS-COUNT  PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.
01 WS-CLEAN  PIC X(20) VALUE "".
01 WS-SUB    PIC X(5)  VALUE "".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    STRING WS-FIRST DELIMITED BY SIZE " " DELIMITED BY SIZE WS-LAST INTO WS-FULL.
    DISPLAY "Full: " WS-FULL.

    UNSTRING WS-CSV DELIMITED BY "," INTO WS-A WS-B WS-C.
    DISPLAY "1: " WS-A.
    DISPLAY "2: " WS-B.
    DISPLAY "3: " WS-C.

    INSPECT WS-TEXT TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL "a".
    DISPLAY "count a: " WS-COUNT.

    INSPECT WS-TEXT REPLACING ALL "a" BY "o".
    DISPLAY "replaced: " WS-TEXT.

    MOVE WS-LAST(1:4) TO WS-SUB.
    DISPLAY "sub: " WS-SUB.
    STOP RUN.
